 5 │ Welcome to another issue of our monthly newsletter where we share updates from the night sky to the latest happenings at our local astronomy club! As we look back on a fantastic month, let's dive into what transpired during our last star party, explore the beauty captured by one of our members, and get excited about upcoming events. This newsletter is filled with celestial delights that await us all.
   · ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
