  9 │ Our February star party was an absolute success! Over 40 eager astronomers gathered at our observatory site to observe the night sky through various telescopes, learn from experienced guides, and share their passion for astronomy. The clear weather provided excellent visibility of the Milky Way, as well as several bright planets including Jupiter and Mars.
    · ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    ·                                                                                                                                                                                    ╰── Dms tell: dms.machine
