 10 │ 
 11 │ We had a special guest, Dr. Emily Starbright (pseudonym), who shared her expertise in deep-sky imaging. She guided us through the night sky using state-of-the-art equipment, making our star party even more engaging than ever before. The highlight of the evening was undoubtedly the view of Saturn and its rings, illuminated by a full moon. Participants were impressed not only with what they saw but also with how to capture such celestial beauty.
    · ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
