 16 │ 
 17 │ Jane's images showcase a vibrant pinkish region of gas clouds and stars within the Orion Nebula, illuminated by the intense radiation from massive young stars. She shared her process with us, including tips on adjusting exposure times to capture fine details while balancing noise reduction techniques. The result is nothing short of breathtaking—a testament to Jane’s dedication and skill.
    · ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
